WEBVTT

00:25.310 --> 00:26.910
That's amazing, Kanae.

00:26.910 --> 00:28.170
You broke your record again.

00:28.420 --> 00:29.290
Really?

00:29.610 --> 00:31.950
You're so lucky you don't have breasts.

00:31.950 --> 00:34.380
You don't get as much resistance.

00:34.680 --> 00:35.830
Just kidd—

00:37.310 --> 00:39.580
I-It's a joke.

00:42.080 --> 00:44.380
Kanae, are you angry?

00:44.380 --> 00:45.560
Not at all.

00:45.780 --> 00:47.260
You're totally angry.

00:47.740 --> 00:49.960
The exam's such a pain.

00:49.960 --> 00:52.030
Kanae, can I borrow your notes?

00:52.030 --> 00:53.070
Sure.

00:53.880 --> 00:55.450
You're angry, aren't you?

00:57.940 --> 00:59.250
Give me a second.

00:59.250 --> 01:00.650
I'm going to go get my notes.

01:00.650 --> 01:01.320
'Kay.

01:05.140 --> 01:06.790
Welcome home, Kana—

01:11.980 --> 01:14.640
Who was that hot guy?

01:15.000 --> 01:16.840
And, uh, what about your notes?

01:20.590 --> 01:23.930
Damn it, please don't show
up dressed like that.

01:24.230 --> 01:26.520
Why am I in trouble?

01:26.940 --> 01:30.060
I was going to give you a
welcome home kis— Ow!

01:30.540 --> 01:32.990
I could get in deep trouble
if people find out

01:32.990 --> 01:35.690
a student like me is living
with some stranger.

01:36.130 --> 01:37.740
Also, that's my towel.

01:37.740 --> 01:39.640
Who gave you permission to use it?

01:39.640 --> 01:41.330
Sorry, can I borrow it?

01:41.330 --> 01:42.270
You may not.

01:43.090 --> 01:45.020
Just watch yourself from now on.

01:45.020 --> 01:46.080
Understood?

01:56.420 --> 01:58.130
Her face was beet red.

01:58.750 --> 02:00.430
What's she being so shy about?

02:00.850 --> 02:02.890
She's angry, Wolf.

02:03.150 --> 02:06.020
Huh? Wait a second...

02:06.630 --> 02:09.770
She doesn't want other girls to see me.

02:09.770 --> 02:12.150
In other words, she wants
to have me to herself.

02:12.620 --> 02:14.810
She wants to hide that
we're living together.

02:14.810 --> 02:17.390
In other words, she wants
to have me to herself.

02:18.820 --> 02:20.450
Could it be...

02:21.100 --> 02:24.490
Has Kanae fallen in love with me?!

02:28.040 --> 02:28.820
What?

04:00.880 --> 04:04.010
02  "Get It! Musik!"

04:21.420 --> 04:23.360
Tchaiko-chan!

04:24.470 --> 04:26.370
Bąda-sama!

04:51.810 --> 04:53.020
Kanae!

04:53.320 --> 04:54.940
Hey, we're going on a date.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.990
To the amusement park? A restaurant?

04:56.990 --> 04:59.230
I'll go anywhere you want to go.

05:00.820 --> 05:03.780
Come on, why won't you talk to me?

05:04.050 --> 05:06.710
No, you don't need to say anything.

05:06.710 --> 05:09.160
I know how you feel.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.500
It happens, huh?

05:10.500 --> 05:13.120
Like, how you become cold
to the person you like.

05:13.120 --> 05:14.270
Yup, yup.

05:14.270 --> 05:15.700
You don't have to be shy.

05:15.700 --> 05:18.650
I'll escargot you all the way.

05:18.650 --> 05:19.670
Escargot?

05:20.200 --> 05:22.300
Was that the right word?

05:23.690 --> 05:25.580
Oh, <i>escort</i>!

05:29.130 --> 05:31.220
Pfft, getting all embarrassed.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.680
Huh?

05:32.940 --> 05:34.370
Are you serious? Kanae!

05:34.370 --> 05:35.280
Hey!

05:35.640 --> 05:37.780
Kanae!

05:41.150 --> 05:44.650
I can't deal with it!

05:45.070 --> 05:48.290
Gotta love that Claskey Klasky sound.

05:48.290 --> 05:50.740
I totally respect them, as a fellow artist.

05:51.500 --> 05:54.620
Since when were you an artist, Sousuke?

05:54.620 --> 05:56.750
Look at reality.

05:56.750 --> 05:59.000
I sang with desktop music!

05:57.020 --> 05:59.630
This is all the views you
got on your new song.

05:59.040 --> 05:59.630
8 Views

05:59.630 --> 06:00.850
Shut up!

06:00.850 --> 06:03.760
And they're all your own views, aren't they?

06:02.970 --> 06:03.910
Who cares?

06:03.910 --> 06:06.770
I have my Musik. I'm good to go.

06:06.770 --> 06:07.760
Musik?

06:08.280 --> 06:11.220
That was some awesome stuff the other day.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.600
Who are those guys?

06:13.950 --> 06:16.120
Maybe they really are geniuses.

06:17.540 --> 06:20.090
There's nothing in the recording, though.

06:20.090 --> 06:21.870
That's the thing.

06:21.870 --> 06:23.400
Perhaps it was an illusion.

06:23.650 --> 06:24.920
No way!

06:24.920 --> 06:27.030
I'm going to break the secret.

06:27.030 --> 06:28.780
And I'm going to learn
to use it, and someday,

06:29.960 --> 06:32.330
I'm going to stand on the grand stage.

06:33.820 --> 06:36.150
You're actually going to use Musik?

06:38.490 --> 06:39.870
Beethes-san, can I talk to you?

06:40.130 --> 06:41.490
What is this?!

06:41.490 --> 06:43.880
Who's going to eat all this?!

06:44.300 --> 06:46.670
But why, gyoza?!

06:46.020 --> 06:47.660
I never said you could use
all these ingredients!

06:47.660 --> 06:48.810
Are you listening?

06:48.810 --> 06:50.520
You better take care of all this yourself.

06:49.000 --> 06:50.330
I'll ask later.

06:50.520 --> 06:51.680
I'm not eating it!

06:53.050 --> 06:54.180
You wanted to ask me something?

06:54.470 --> 06:57.160
Yeah, about that Musik thing.

06:57.160 --> 06:58.800
You can do it, too, can't you?

06:59.100 --> 07:01.560
There's something I wanted to ask you, too.

07:02.010 --> 07:03.560
My special abilities?

07:03.910 --> 07:05.650
Does Kanae have a boyfriend?

07:05.980 --> 07:08.110
I want to get to use it, too.

07:08.110 --> 07:10.700
She's so shy. We're not getting anywhere.

07:10.940 --> 07:13.110
So teach me how to do it.

07:13.110 --> 07:15.480
Hey, what do you think she'll appreciate?

07:17.460 --> 07:18.860
Are you listening?!

07:28.090 --> 07:28.940
No thanks.

07:28.940 --> 07:30.010
I'm eating ice cream.

07:31.290 --> 07:32.630
I'll take it.

07:32.630 --> 07:35.240
Sousuke, why are you even here?

07:35.240 --> 07:36.800
Go home already.

07:36.800 --> 07:38.990
Hey, it's legit good.

07:38.990 --> 07:41.230
Alas, this is not it!

07:41.230 --> 07:43.720
Kanae, where should we go for our date?

07:47.750 --> 07:49.820
I have something to say to you all.

07:50.130 --> 07:52.680
Kanae wants to talk?! Listen!

07:52.980 --> 07:56.600
First, please don't use the stuff
in the fridge so liberally.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.500
No! You thieves!

07:58.500 --> 08:01.230
And no going outside dressed like a creep.

08:01.230 --> 08:02.650
No! Public nuisance!

08:02.650 --> 08:03.930
Oh, you mean me?

08:03.930 --> 08:07.040
Finally, if you're going to
live here, from now on...

08:07.920 --> 08:09.760
You'll be paying rent!

08:10.010 --> 08:11.570
Pay ren—

08:12.240 --> 08:13.840
Er... What?!

08:14.180 --> 08:15.650
Thank you for the food.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.270
This is bad.

08:20.890 --> 08:22.810
We should try to get on her good side.

08:23.880 --> 08:26.980
I will allow no one to impede my creations.

08:28.140 --> 08:30.460
Boy, pay my rent, please.

08:30.460 --> 08:31.580
Why me?!

08:31.580 --> 08:33.110
Do you think we have any money?!

08:33.390 --> 08:34.770
I don't, either!

08:34.770 --> 08:35.570
I'm begging you.

08:35.570 --> 08:36.240
What?!

08:42.970 --> 08:44.050
I'm exhausted.

08:48.090 --> 08:49.270
Are you okay?

08:49.270 --> 08:50.400
Is something wrong?

08:50.680 --> 08:52.550
Stuff.

08:53.230 --> 08:55.940
You shouldn't bottle it up too much.

08:56.240 --> 08:59.010
You can be a bit too gung-ho sometimes.

09:01.030 --> 09:04.280
You've forgotten about your
birthday, haven't you?

09:04.280 --> 09:04.900
Huh?

09:05.560 --> 09:06.390
Oh!

09:09.710 --> 09:11.440
Uzuki...

09:11.680 --> 09:13.950
I want to go hang out.

09:13.950 --> 09:15.950
I want something good to eat.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.090
Sashimi!

09:17.090 --> 09:17.910
Meat!

09:17.910 --> 09:18.950
Madelienes!

09:18.950 --> 09:20.460
And carbonara!

09:20.460 --> 09:21.950
And fried rice!

09:22.790 --> 09:24.160
Listen up!

09:24.870 --> 09:27.370
We're going to hold a
birthday party for Kanae.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.530
Kanae's got a lot going on right now.

09:29.830 --> 09:32.990
We can live in the mansion now,
but we have to be frugal.

09:32.990 --> 09:33.910
So!

09:33.910 --> 09:37.630
We're going to celebrate her birthday and
have her forgive our usual annoyingness!

09:39.560 --> 09:40.640
No reaction?

09:41.200 --> 09:42.740
Sorry, but I must work on my creations.

09:42.740 --> 09:44.390
That won't even matter,
if you get kicked out.

09:44.700 --> 09:46.690
In that case, as her boyfriend, I...

09:46.690 --> 09:48.640
Just help me out!

09:49.830 --> 09:51.900
What are we doing for a party?

09:51.900 --> 09:53.760
Isn't it obvious?

09:54.740 --> 09:56.520
Musik.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.710
Listen up, guys.

10:04.710 --> 10:08.000
The gig is in five days.

10:08.000 --> 10:11.400
In that time, we've got to figure out

10:11.400 --> 10:14.670
what triggers the mysterious Musik.

10:14.670 --> 10:16.380
Why Musik?

10:16.380 --> 10:17.930
Can't we just have a normal party?

10:18.170 --> 10:20.520
That's so lame.

10:20.520 --> 10:24.590
I bet Kanae will be impressed
if she sees your Musik.

10:24.590 --> 10:27.940
Like, "Oh, my god, that was
awesome! I thought you were

10:27.940 --> 10:30.190
kind of stupid, but I take it back."

10:30.190 --> 10:31.340
Sousuke!

10:32.850 --> 10:35.080
Please and thank you.

10:35.080 --> 10:36.830
Yes, please and thank you.

10:37.970 --> 10:39.460
Beethes-san, you're the key person.

10:40.440 --> 10:44.180
You're the one who actually
pulled it off last time.

10:44.180 --> 10:46.290
But there's a problem...

10:46.290 --> 10:48.780
Beethes-san says he doesn't know

10:48.780 --> 10:50.750
how he released his Musik!

10:50.750 --> 10:51.540
What?!

10:51.540 --> 10:53.040
Get it together, Lud-kun!

10:53.040 --> 10:54.040
Seriously!

10:54.690 --> 10:55.550
What?

10:55.850 --> 10:57.950
First, Beethes-san has to remember

10:57.950 --> 11:00.050
how he pulled off the Musik.

11:00.050 --> 11:02.040
Then, Motes-san reproduces it perfectly.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.510
That way,

11:04.260 --> 11:05.760
we can be sure to have Musik!

11:05.760 --> 11:06.970
Indeed.

11:06.970 --> 11:08.950
I will have it done, young man.

11:08.950 --> 11:10.280
I don't mean make an impression.

11:10.280 --> 11:11.140
Do what he did.

11:11.140 --> 11:13.170
This is my fate!

11:13.170 --> 11:14.360
Be serious about it.

11:14.790 --> 11:16.190
I'm totally serious!

11:16.600 --> 11:17.640
All right.

11:17.640 --> 11:19.350
Let's get right to it.

11:19.650 --> 11:21.100
Ready, and...

11:21.100 --> 11:23.770
Let's Musik!

11:26.730 --> 11:27.420
Huh?

11:29.130 --> 11:30.360
Hey, Sousuke.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.330
Sousuke!

11:31.620 --> 11:33.590
Why are we making gyoza?

11:33.590 --> 11:35.190
To trigger the Musik.

11:35.570 --> 11:36.880
Does this even matter?

11:36.880 --> 11:38.670
Beethes-san says so.

11:38.970 --> 11:40.040
I have no doubt.

11:40.340 --> 11:41.190
I'm bored of this.

11:41.190 --> 11:42.110
Oh, really?

11:42.410 --> 11:44.570
Want Beethes-san to Musik, then?

11:44.570 --> 11:45.320
No.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.870
I have to be the one celebrating
Kanae's birthday.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.400
Get to it, then.

11:49.400 --> 11:50.100
Okay.

11:50.640 --> 11:53.280
Sousuke, are you sure
the birthday celebration

11:53.280 --> 11:55.650
isn't just an excuse to see Musi—

11:56.940 --> 11:58.030
It's done.

11:58.300 --> 12:00.690
It is my masterpiece, boy.

12:00.690 --> 12:02.640
I told you, you don't have
to do the impressions.

12:02.940 --> 12:04.660
Okay, Beethes-san, what's next?

12:05.140 --> 12:06.320
A wrecking ball.

12:06.680 --> 12:07.410
A wrecking ball?

12:07.870 --> 12:08.540
Yeah.

12:08.840 --> 12:12.410
It's what sent my work to the ground.

12:12.680 --> 12:14.470
I was soon awash in emotions,

12:14.880 --> 12:16.120
and the melodies came to me.

12:16.410 --> 12:19.050
A wrecking ball?
Where are we going to get one?

12:22.710 --> 12:24.220
You guys are insane!

12:24.940 --> 12:27.220
Okay, Lud-kun, you got this.

12:27.500 --> 12:29.350
Yes, you got this.

12:29.350 --> 12:30.980
Don't "You got this" me!

12:29.350 --> 12:31.100
Wrecking
Ball

12:30.980 --> 12:31.810
Let me down!

12:32.110 --> 12:34.200
We're just going through
the motions, Sousuke.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.690
This isn't "just going through the motions!"

12:35.690 --> 12:37.190
You're totally going to
smash me against the house!

12:37.900 --> 12:39.780
B-Beethes-san...

12:40.940 --> 12:43.780
We're just going through the motions, boy.

12:44.090 --> 12:45.980
Okay, go for it.

12:45.980 --> 12:47.690
Yeah, here I go!

12:50.040 --> 12:51.940
Motes-san, what are you doing?

12:56.370 --> 12:58.170
All three of you!

12:58.170 --> 13:01.080
What the Hell was going through your heads?

13:01.080 --> 13:02.290
Seriously!

13:02.290 --> 13:02.920
I've had enough—

13:09.890 --> 13:12.390
Backing up. Backing up.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.590
Backing up. Backing up.

14:11.870 --> 14:14.240
Take this!

14:17.330 --> 14:18.750
Yay!

14:18.750 --> 14:21.010
I'm unstoppable!

14:21.010 --> 14:21.660
Yeah.

14:21.660 --> 14:23.560
You've attained the strength to

14:23.560 --> 14:26.260
survive respectably without Musik.

14:27.510 --> 14:29.320
No!

14:39.870 --> 14:41.000
This isn't working.

14:41.000 --> 14:41.780
No go.

14:44.120 --> 14:45.820
What can we do?

14:45.820 --> 14:46.900
Let's give up.

14:47.150 --> 14:48.600
No way.

14:48.600 --> 14:50.800
Don't you want to impress Kanae?

14:50.800 --> 14:51.430
Huh?

14:51.720 --> 14:54.030
Wait, when's her birthday, again?

14:54.320 --> 14:55.490
Tomorrow.

14:55.490 --> 14:56.040
Tomorrow?

14:56.340 --> 14:57.300
Oh, crap!

14:57.300 --> 14:59.600
We haven't done anything
to prepare for the party.

14:59.600 --> 15:01.480
Who cares?

15:01.480 --> 15:03.290
Why won't it work?

15:03.730 --> 15:04.590
Sousuke...

15:05.220 --> 15:07.180
Maybe we should do the gyoza
and wrecking ball again.

15:07.180 --> 15:08.320
Sousuke!

15:08.320 --> 15:09.340
What?

15:10.950 --> 15:14.680
Kanae's birthday is more
important than Musik.

15:56.230 --> 15:57.770
I'm home.

16:00.760 --> 16:01.840
Hasshie?

16:11.610 --> 16:15.570
Happy birthday, Kanae!

16:17.830 --> 16:18.990
Happy birthday.

16:19.220 --> 16:20.760
Happy birthday.

16:23.870 --> 16:25.460
We were waiting for you, you know.

16:25.460 --> 16:27.120
You're so late.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.500
You guys scared me.

16:28.500 --> 16:35.140
Kanae-chan Happy Birthday!!

16:28.790 --> 16:30.610
Kagura-kun invited us.

16:30.610 --> 16:32.200
Oh, really?

16:32.200 --> 16:34.200
Thanks, Sousuke.

16:34.550 --> 16:35.140
Nah.

16:35.140 --> 16:36.880
Me, too!

16:36.880 --> 16:39.020
I did those decorations.

16:39.020 --> 16:41.210
And those crappy ones are by Sousuke.

16:41.210 --> 16:42.270
They aren't crappy!

16:42.270 --> 16:44.680
You can totally tell Sousuke did it.

16:43.350 --> 16:44.680
They aren't crappy!

16:44.680 --> 16:45.520
You, too, Beethes-san.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.900
The gyoza is delicious.

16:47.900 --> 16:48.980
Thank you.

16:50.260 --> 16:51.910
Say something nice about me, too!

16:51.910 --> 16:52.760
Come on!

17:06.290 --> 17:08.190
That was good.

17:07.290 --> 17:08.880
I know.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.100
I ate too much.

17:16.380 --> 17:17.520
Thank goodness.

17:19.810 --> 17:20.600
Are you all right?

17:20.900 --> 17:21.750
What's up?

17:22.050 --> 17:25.690
I feel like I'm about to remember something.

17:25.690 --> 17:27.480
Is it the Musik?

17:28.180 --> 17:29.490
What was it?

17:29.490 --> 17:32.990
C-C-Calm down!

17:33.580 --> 17:34.880
I remember!

17:34.880 --> 17:35.630
What is it?

17:36.210 --> 17:39.010
I had a present for Kanae.

17:39.010 --> 17:40.130
Oh, damn it!

17:41.990 --> 17:44.970
Thanks so much, everyone.

17:44.970 --> 17:46.580
Wait!

17:46.880 --> 17:49.100
I have a present for you, too, Kanae.

17:49.100 --> 17:50.490
Hand-made sweets.

17:50.490 --> 17:51.960
You? Motes-san?

17:53.440 --> 17:55.400
I worked really hard on this.

17:55.400 --> 17:57.970
You'll totally love it.

17:57.970 --> 17:59.010
Here we go.

17:59.010 --> 18:00.390
Ready, and...

18:05.010 --> 18:06.520
Huh? What's this?

18:06.520 --> 18:07.850
Booby cakes!

18:08.270 --> 18:10.540
It's what you wanted more
than anything, right?

18:11.100 --> 18:13.540
Mozart, in fact,

18:13.540 --> 18:17.210
liked slightly pervy sweets.

18:15.280 --> 18:17.530
Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart

18:17.760 --> 18:19.880
They're pretty good, huh?

18:19.880 --> 18:21.750
Isn't it hilarious?

18:21.750 --> 18:22.870
So nice...

18:22.870 --> 18:24.600
You...

18:25.750 --> 18:27.550
Pervert!

18:31.790 --> 18:32.420
Pervert!

18:32.730 --> 18:33.550
Pervert!

18:33.550 --> 18:34.250
Pervert!

18:34.390 --> 18:35.510
Pervert!

18:45.260 --> 18:47.640
I remember now!

18:49.000 --> 18:50.520
Because you got slapped?!

18:50.890 --> 18:53.150
Fühle meine...

18:53.700 --> 18:56.610
Musik!

19:05.500 --> 19:08.380
Come with me on my Musik,

19:08.890 --> 19:11.480
to the land of honey and milk!

19:17.200 --> 19:22.470
A serenade for all to sing and dance to

19:22.470 --> 19:29.710
My gift to you, a night
to grant all your wishes

19:33.800 --> 19:35.160
It's pretty.

19:35.690 --> 19:36.920
Damn...

19:36.920 --> 19:38.490
This is legit!

19:38.950 --> 19:42.610
"Eine Kleine Nachtmusik,"
or "A Little Serenade."

19:43.220 --> 19:45.700
It's a serenade perfect for the night.

19:48.010 --> 19:48.870
Kanae,

19:48.100 --> 19:53.710
Fun days go by so fast

19:49.830 --> 19:51.620
this is for you.

19:53.930 --> 19:59.810
Before I know it, the moon's out

19:56.430 --> 19:57.840
And this is for you.

19:59.810 --> 20:04.540
The stars are pretty

20:04.010 --> 20:05.530
And this is for you.

20:04.540 --> 20:10.720
So let's all stick around to watch them

20:05.730 --> 20:06.430
Gyo—

20:07.280 --> 20:08.330
And you!

20:11.020 --> 20:22.500
Let's chat with all the fancy-dressed
people! Congratulations, thank you

20:22.820 --> 20:28.080
Let's share more of our excitement

20:28.370 --> 20:33.800
Let's all dance and sing to this serenade

20:28.840 --> 20:31.340
Happy birthday, Kanae.

20:33.800 --> 20:39.660
Dancing dresses fluttering
to the sparkling, pleasant night

20:36.290 --> 20:37.630
Thank you.

20:39.660 --> 20:45.520
Let's forget all the little
things that bum us out

20:42.450 --> 20:43.590
Happy birthday!

20:43.590 --> 20:45.180
Motes-sama!

20:45.520 --> 20:52.600
I'll give you the gift of a night
that grants all your wishes

20:51.510 --> 20:52.300
Umm...

20:53.350 --> 20:55.460
A present for you

20:53.870 --> 20:56.310
Das Ende!

20:56.800 --> 20:59.750
A present!

21:09.020 --> 21:10.540
Motes-kun!

21:10.540 --> 21:11.900
How did you do that?

21:11.900 --> 21:13.540
What was that? That was great!

21:12.970 --> 21:14.100
Do it again!

21:14.100 --> 21:15.280
I want to see it again!

21:14.490 --> 21:15.900
Again!

21:15.900 --> 21:17.180
I liked it.

21:18.990 --> 21:20.920
Even though it was just a fleeting dream.

21:23.670 --> 21:26.190
But reality...

21:29.470 --> 21:33.060
M-Musik!

21:33.950 --> 21:34.960
I can't...

21:35.570 --> 21:36.860
Why...?

21:36.860 --> 21:38.020
Sousuke?!

21:39.150 --> 21:41.000
Firepower, once again!

21:41.000 --> 21:42.360
Firepower!

21:42.360 --> 21:44.030
Motes-kun!

21:42.440 --> 21:44.030
Motes-sama

21:42.440 --> 21:44.030
I love
Motes-kun

21:45.290 --> 21:47.290
I'm way too popular!

21:47.290 --> 21:48.560
Sorry, Kanae.

21:48.560 --> 21:50.830
You might not get to go out with me.

21:56.120 --> 21:58.350
Motes-kun!

21:58.350 --> 22:02.130
Everyone leave!

22:05.830 --> 22:07.770
Here we are, Cho-chan.

22:10.520 --> 22:12.180
Huh? She's not here.

22:14.470 --> 22:15.760
Damn it.

22:25.560 --> 22:27.670
It's so bad.

22:27.990 --> 22:30.990
To be continued

24:00.870 --> 24:27.070
03: "Cho-chan and Lisz-chan"

24:01.620 --> 24:02.910
Birds of a feather flock together.

24:02.910 --> 24:04.930
Perhaps they were drawn by
the scent of Beethes' gyoza,

24:04.930 --> 24:07.200
or perhaps it's the magnetism
of the shabby, old Otowakan...

24:07.200 --> 24:09.550
Enter two more creepy, pesky, crazies.

24:09.730 --> 24:11.500
Meanwhile we have the
super-shy Wyschnegradsky,

24:11.500 --> 24:13.340
hiding in a cardboard box for years.

24:13.340 --> 24:16.720
A special, beautiful, hyper,
love-love angel of passion!

24:16.720 --> 24:20.060
Entangled in bonds of love,
Musik begins again.

24:20.060 --> 24:21.150
Love is life.

24:21.150 --> 24:22.120
Love is strength.

24:22.120 --> 24:23.220
Love is miracles.

24:23.220 --> 24:24.980
Fine, fine, you get it, you say.

24:24.980 --> 24:26.680
The tl;dr is that if you're
going to live here,

24:26.680 --> 24:28.960
you better pay your deposit,
your fees, and your rent.
